   "lines": [
    "Took Charley Morgan out",
    "driving.",
    "The evenings I",
    "generally spend playing",
    "whist in the club;",
    "unless we make up",
    "a theatre party. As",
    "I am rather apt",
    "to end up with a",
    "little supper, I find I",
    "dont get to bed very",
    "early."
